msgid "Chromatic Aberration"
msgstr "Klöörafwieken"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:129
msgid "Chromatic aberration is easily recognized as color fringes towards the image corners. CA is due to a varying lens focus for different colors."
msgstr "Klöörafwieken lett sik eenfach kennen, dat gifft Klöörränners na't Bild sien Huken hen. De Lins hett denn verscheden Brennwieden för de Klören."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:132
msgid "Vignetting"
msgstr "Randschadden"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:133
msgid "Vignetting refers to an image darkening, mostly in the corners. Optical and natural vignetting can be canceled out with this option, whereas mechanical vignetting will not be cured."
msgstr "Randschadden bedüüdt, dat Bild warrt tomehrst na de Huken hen düüsterer. Optisch un natüürlich Randschaddens laat sik mit disse Funkschoon wegmaken, mechaansche nich."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:136
msgid "Color Correction"
msgstr "Klöörrichten"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:137
msgid "All lenses have a slight color tinge to them, mostly due to the anti-reflective coating. The tinge can be canceled when the respective data is known for the lens."
msgstr "All Linsen hebbt en Klöörfehler, in de Hööftsaak kummt dat vun de Antireflex-Laag. Disse Fehler lett sik richten, wenn Du de tohören Daten vun de Lins kennen deist."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:140
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "Vertarren"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:141
msgid "Distortion refers to an image deformation, which is most pronounced towards the corners. These Seidel aberrations are known as pincushion and barrel distortions."
msgstr "Vertarren is en leeg Weddergaav vun de Formen op't Bild un warrt na de Huken hen stärker. Disse Afbildfehlers sünd as »Küssen-« un »Tünnvertarren« begäng."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:144
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Geometrie"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:145
msgid "Four geometries are handled here: Rectilinear (99 percent of all lenses), Fisheye, Cylindrical, Equirectangular."
msgstr "Hier sünd veer Buuformen mööglich: Liekut (99% Perzent vun all Linsen), Fischoog, Zylinnersch un Längdenliek Zylinnersch."

