"<p>Files with these extensions will be recognized as audio files and included into the database:<br/>"
" <code>%1</code></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dateien mit disse Verwiedern warrt as Klangdateien kennt un na de Datenbank opnahmen:<br/>"
"<code>%1</code></p>"

