#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>digiKam use root album paths to store your photo albums created in <b>My Albums</b> view from left side-bar. Below, please select which folder you would like digiKam to use as first root album path from your local file system.</p>"
#~ "<p><b>Note: you can set other root album paths later using digiKam settings panel. Removable medias and shared files system are supported.</b></p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>DigiKam bruukt Wörtelalben-Padden för't Sekern vun Dien Fotoalben, de Du linkerhand binnen <b>Mien Alben</b> opstellt hest. Söök bitte nerrn en Orner binnen Dien lokaal Dateisysteem ut, den digiKam as den eersten Wörtelalbum-Padd bruken schall.</p>"
#~ "<p><b>Beacht bitte: Du kannst later binnen dat Instellenpaneel ok noch anner Wörtelalben-Padden fastleggen. Tuuschbor Medien un feern, deelt Dateisystemen warrt nich ünnerstütt.</b></p>"

#~ msgid ""
